  "plain": "A small dirt road near the place in Varginha, Brazil, where strange beings are said to have been seen in 1996 is said to lead straight to EsSA, the Brazilian army's school for sergeants. The surgeon Carlos de Souza, whose hospital is said to have been involved in the case, says he didn't know this himself. He was told it by the documentary maker James Fox and by people in the UFO research community. It matters to the story because it would put the army right next to the scene."
